<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Drupal on diamon@truediamon.ru:~$</title><link>https://truediamon.ru/tags/drupal/</link><description>Recent content in Drupal on diamon@truediamon.ru:~$</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>ru-ru</language><copyright>Содержимое доступно по лицензии [Attribution-NonCommercial-NoDerivatives 4.0 Creative Commons](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/deed.ru)</copyright><lastBuildDate>Sat, 19 Apr 2008 11:00:29 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://truediamon.ru/tags/drupal/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>редирект RSS на FeedBurner в Drupal</title><link>https://truediamon.ru/content/redirekt-rss-na-feedburner-v-drupal/</link><pubDate>Sat, 19 Apr 2008 11:00:29 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://truediamon.ru/content/redirekt-rss-na-feedburner-v-drupal/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;пост больше для себя, дабы не забыть. добавляем в .htaccess в корне друпала:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight-wrapper"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="highlight-toolbar"&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;span class="highlight-lang"&gt;.htaccess&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;button type="button" class="highlight-copy" data-copied="Скопировано"&gt;Копировать&lt;/button&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-.htaccess" data-lang=".htaccess"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;RewriteCond&lt;/span&gt; %{HTTP_HOST} ^truediamon\.ru$ [NC]&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;RewriteCond&lt;/span&gt; %{HTTP_USER_AGENT} !FeedBurner.*&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;RewriteRule&lt;/span&gt; ^rss.xml$ &amp;lt;a href=&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;http://feeds.feedburner.com/truediamon&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; title=&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;http://feeds.feedburner.com/truediamon&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;gt;http://feeds.feedburner.com/truediamon&amp;lt;/a&amp;gt; [L,R=301]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>